# VerbCoin example: the opening speech, the verb coin on the duck, the
# tunnel into the room with a z-buffer, and the inventory. Positions are in
# game pixels (640x480).
#
# Point at the middle of the duck (hit testing of the sprite) and open the
# verb coin, which freezes the scene and mixes the coin into it.
700 move 200 340
720 click 200 340
# Choose "look at", which is at 45, 35 in the coin, whose corner is 50, 52
# above and left of the mouse.
760 move 195 323
800 click 195 323
# Walk through the tunnel, behind the walls of the z-buffer.
1200 click 75 320
# Open the inventory.
1900 move 90 435
1920 click 90 435
2000 capture
2100 quit
